         <div type="edition" xml:lang="kaw-Latn" rendition="class:38769 maturity:83213">
     <p><lb n="1"/><g type="symbol" ref="sym:circle-lined">*</g> tulus aṅalu<lb n="2" break="no"/>sa den· kada
        <lb n="3"/>botaṅ akasa
        <lb n="4"/>lavan· pr̥tivi so<supplied reason="omitted">r</supplied>
        <lb n="5" break="no"/>ga kabuk·tiha<g type="symbol" ref="sym:circle-lined">*</g>
     </p>
       
        <div type="translation" resp="part:argr part:masc">
        <p>Permanently leading the life of hermits, let them experience heaven (i.e., as long as) sky and earth.</p>

        </div>
         </div>
         <div type="commentary"><p/>
         </div>
